      "content_body": "Users reporting 'access denied' or seeing wrong tenant data usually indicate a scope/consent mismatch or incorrect permissions assigned within Token Service. Operator error during initial setup is a common root cause, particularly when conditional access policies are too restrictive or misapplied. Check if the issue is an unexpected permission denial by reviewing the specific policy rules and consent flags. Resolutions involve correcting the policy configuration, updating permissions, or completing a formal access review to align roles with actual needs. Always validate that the token scopes match the required access levels for the operation being performed."
